{"id":"n5-081","title":"すぐに～ (sugu ni～)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Immediately or right away; used to express promptness or quickness.","longExplanation":"The すぐに～ grammar point is used to express an action happening immediately or right away. It often indicates promptness or quickness and can be used with both verbs and adjectives.","formation":"すぐに + Verb/Adjective","examples":[{"jp":"友達が来たら、すぐに電話をかけてください。","romaji":"Tomodachi ga kitara, sugu ni denwa wo kakete kudasai.","en":"When my friend arrives, please call me right away.","words":[{"surface":"友達","vocabId":"1540170","reading":"ともだち"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"電話","vocabId":"1443840","reading":"でんわ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かけ","vocabId":"1590040","reading":"かけ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"そのニュースを聞いたら、すぐに会社に行きました。","romaji":"Sono nyuusu wo kiitara, sugu ni kaisha ni ikimashita.","en":"Upon hearing that news, I went to the company immediately.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ニュース","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"聞い","vocabId":"1591110","reading":"きく"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会社","vocabId":"1198550","reading":"かいしゃ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女はすぐに泣き出した。","romaji":"Kanojo wa sugu ni nakidashita.","en":"She started crying right away.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"泣き","vocabId":"1229650","reading":"なき"},{"surface":"出し","vocabId":"1339160","reading":"だし"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"教室に入ると、先生はすぐに授業を始めた。","romaji":"Kyoushitsu ni hairu to, sensei wa sugu ni jugyou wo hajimeta.","en":"As soon as I entered the classroom, the teacher started the lesson immediately.","words":[{"surface":"教室","vocabId":"1237150","reading":"きょうしつ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"入る","vocabId":"1465590","reading":"はいる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"先生","vocabId":"1387990","reading":"せんせい"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"授業","vocabId":"1330290","reading":"じゅぎょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"始め","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}